60px;\n        margin: 0;\n        box-shadow: none;\n        transform-origin: top left;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <header>\n      <div class=\"top-rule\">\n        <span class=\"brand\">同步解析与测评</span>\n        <span class=\"book-info\">数学　五年级　下册</span>\n      </div>\n      <h1>3. 分数加减混合运算</h1>\n      <h2>第 1 课时　分数加减混合运算</h2>\n      <div class=\"explore\">\n        <span>探究</span>\n        <span class=\"explore-badge\">分篇</span>\n      </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <section class=\"columns\">\n      <div class=\"column left-column\">\n        <p class=\"intro\">小华收集整理的全班同学在母亲节送给妈妈的礼物情况如下表。</p>\n\n        <table>\n          <tr>\n            <th>礼物类型</th>\n            <th>贺卡</th>\n            <th>鲜花</th>\n            <th>自己画的画</th>\n            <th>其他</th>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>占全班人数的<br>几分之几</td>\n            <td>$\\frac{1}{4}$</td>\n            <td>$\\frac{3}{20}$</td>\n            <td>$\\frac{3}{10}$</td>\n            <td></td>\n          </tr>\n        </table>\n\n        <p class=\"question\">1. 送贺卡和送鲜花的同学比送自己画的画的同学多占全班人数的几分之几？</p>\n\n        <p class=\"method\">方法一：</p>\n        <div class=\"calculation\">\n          <div class=\"calc-line\">$\\frac{1}{4}+\\frac{3}{20}-\\frac{3}{10}$</div>\n          <div class=\"calc-line\">$\\displaystyle =\\frac{\\color{#b32239}{5}}{20}+\\frac{3}{20}-\\frac{3}{10}$ <span class=\"note-arrow\">—— 通分</span></div>\n          <div class=\"calc-line\">$\\displaystyle =\\frac{\\color{#b32239}{8}}{20}-\\frac{3}{10}$</div>\n          <div class=\"calc-line\">$\\displaystyle =\\frac{\\color{#b32239}{8}}{20}-\\frac{\\color{#b32239}{6}}{20}$ <span class=\"note-arrow\">—— 再次通分</span></div>\n          <div class=\"calc-line\">$\\displaystyle =\\frac{\\color{#b32239}{2}}{20}$</div>\n          <div class=\"calc-line\">$\\displaystyle =\\frac{\\color{#b32239}{1}}{\\color{#b32239}{10}}$</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"method\">方法二：</p>\n        <div class=\"calculation method-two\">\n          <div class=\"calc-line\">$\\frac{1}{4}+\\frac{3}{20}-\\frac{3}{10}$</div>\n          <div class=\"calc-line\">$\\displaystyle =\\frac{\\color{#b32239}{5}}{20}+\\frac{3}{20}-\\frac{\\color{#b32239}{6}}{20}$ <span class=\"note-arrow\">—— 一次通分</span></div>\n          <div class=\"calc-line\">$\\displaystyle =\\frac{\\color{#b32239}{2}}{20}$</div>\n          <div class=\"calc-line\">$\\displaystyle =\\frac{\\color{#b32239}{1}}{\\color{#b32239}{10}}$</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"column right-column\">\n        <div class=\"right-top\">\n          <div class=\"figure-head\"></div>\n          <div class=\"speech speech-top\">这两种方法有什么不同？哪一种简便？</div>\n          <div class=\"thought\">通分次数不同，<br>方法二简便</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"question\">2. 送其他礼物的同学占全班人数的几分之几？</p>\n\n        <p class=\"method\">方法一：</p>\n        <div class=\"calculation right-calc\">\n          <div class=\"calc-line\">$1-\\frac{1}{4}-\\frac{3}{20}-\\frac{3}{10}$</div>\n          <div class=\"calc-line hand\">$\\displaystyle =1-\\frac{5}{20}-\\frac{3}{20}-\\frac{6}{20}$</div>\n          <div class=\"calc-line hand\">$\\displaystyle =\\frac{20}{20}-\\frac{5}{20}-\\frac{3}{20}-\\frac{6}{20}$</div>\n          <div class=\"calc-line hand\">$\\displaystyle =\\frac{6}{20}$</div>\n          <div class=\"calc-line hand\">$\\displaystyle =\\frac{3}{10}$</div>\n          <div class=\"side-callout\">这两个算式有什么不同呢？</div>\n          <div class=\"person-small\">\n            <span class=\"head\"></span>\n            <span class=\"body\"></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"method\">方法二：</p>\n        <div class=\"calculation right-calc method-two\">\n          <div class=\"calc-line\">$1-\\left(\\frac{1}{4}+\\frac{3}{20}+\\frac{3}{10}\\right)$</div>\n          <div class=\"calc-line hand\">$\\displaystyle =1-\\left(\\frac{5}{20}+\\frac{3}{20}+\\frac{6}{20}\\right)$</div>\n          <div class=\"calc-line hand\">$\\displaystyle =1-\\frac{14}{20}$</div>\n          <div class=\"calc-line hand\">$\\displaystyle =\\frac{6}{20}$</div>\n          <div class=\"calc-line hand\">$\\displaystyle =\\frac{3}{10}$</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"summary\">\n          <p class=\"question\">3. 通过前面的计算，你能说一说分数加减混合运算的运算顺序吗？</p>\n\n          <div class=\"summary-row\">\n            <div class=\"person-large\">\n              <span class=\"head\"></span>\n              <span class=\"body\"></span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"bubble\">\n              分数加减混合运算的运算顺序和整数加减混合运算的运算顺序（<span class=\"fill\">相同</span>）。\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"summary-row second\">\n            <div class=\"bubble\">\n              没有括号的，按照（<span class=\"fill\">从左到右</span>）的顺序计算；有括号的，先算（<span class=\"fill\">括号里面</span>）再算（<span class=\"fill\">括号外面</span>）。\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"person-large\">\n              <span class=\"head\"></span>\n              <span class=\"body\"></span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n      <span>※</span>\n      <span class=\"page-number\">70</span>\n      <span>____</span>\n    </footer>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
